:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sy</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bouchard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bouchard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">DESCRIPTION</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> OK<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> preparing </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bouchard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> checking DESCRIPTION meta</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">information </span><span style=\"color:#660\">...</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> OK<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> checking </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> LF line</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">endings </span><span style=\"color:#008\">in</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> source </span><span style=\"color:#008\">and</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> make files<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> checking </span><span style=\"color:#008\">for</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> empty </span><span style=\"color:#008\">or</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> unneeded directories<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> looking to see </span><span style=\"color:#008\">if</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> a </span><span style=\"color:#660\">‘</span><span style=\"color:#000\">data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">datalist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">’</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file should be added<br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">*